// The registry this repo's parts/ and blocks/ build into, with `orbe registry build . <out>`.
// docs/registry.md says what it holds.
{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "@orbefab",
  "homepage": "https://orbefab.com/orbe",
  // Part ids that `orbe search` and the site's parts list leave out. The parts stay in the
  // registry, including as the parts inside a board. A part file's `listed` field is ignored.
